# Its id leads with aspect-: a State of the same name (Raging, Mindful, God Ki) has the bare one.
id: aspect-blutz-wave
name: Blutz Wave
polarity: negative
# number: its script is the whole of it. moment: entering, leaving, the start of a turn (stages 4-5).
# rule: how a Transformation is entered, left or Mastered - asked by transformations.mjs aspectLevel.
group: rule
# The rule as read on 2026-11-12, in short; its own words (`text:`) to come from the user.
summary: >
  Only with the Tailed Option of Saiyan Heritage; losing your tail you leave it and suffer Stress Exhaustion. A Called Shot at the tail: Damage Category -1. Counts as the Great Ape Transformation Line for your Traits.

---

# Nothing it does by itself yet: the Transformation Maneuver and Mastery read it.
